text Naranja_MurcottIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_08180602 {
    "Want a tip for battling?\pI’d say it’s raising different kinds\nof POKéMON in a balanced manner.\pIt’s no good to make just one\nPOKéMON strong.\pIf it has a type disadvantage, it\nmight not stand a chance."
}

text Naranja_MurcottIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_081806CB {
    "I trade POKéMON with my friends.\pIf a traded POKéMON is holding an\nitem, it makes me twice as happy!"
